“いっせーのー”で鳴り響いたスタートの合図
With a "Ready, set, go!" the start signal rang out,

3
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:44,200
なぞった線で結んだ世界
Connecting the world with traced lines...

4
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:49,000
色付けていくここから
...coloring it from here on out.

5
00:04:49,500 --> 00:04:56,500
かくれんぼ
[Title: Hide-and-Seek]

6
00:04:57,200 --> 00:05:03,000
物心がつく頃すでに此処にあった
By the time I was old enough to understand, it was already here.

7
00:05:02,728 --> 00:05:07,828
繋いだ誰かの記憶は 夕日と共に蘇る
The connected memories of someone
revive with the sunset

8
00:05:07,828 --> 00:05:13,228
古ぼけた絵本を飛び出して
Flying out of a worn-out picture book

9
00:05:13,228 --> 00:05:18,228
落書きの中に一つの答えを見つけた
I found a single answer inside the doodles

10
00:05:18,228 --> 00:05:23,228
自分の価値に目を疑って どこまでだって落ちていけるの
Doubting my own worth,
how far down can I fall?

11
00:05:23,228 --> 00:05:29,228
どこか遠くに消えてしまいたい こんな世界じゃ僕は要らない
I want to disappear somewhere far away,
in a world like this I'm not needed

12
00:05:29,228 --> 00:05:34,228
カウントダウンは始まっているよ
The countdown has already begun

13
00:05:34,228 --> 00:05:39,728
いっせーのーで、声を上げて 聞こえてくるんだ
On the count of three, raise your voice,
I can hear it coming

14
00:05:39,728 --> 00:05:45,228
自分の影の長さに気付くもうこんな時間だ
Noticing the length of my own shadow,
it's already this late

15
00:05:45,228 --> 00:05:50,228
一等星が顔を出した 届きそうで手を伸ばした
The brightest star has appeared,
I reached out my hand as if I could touch it

16
00:05:50,228 --> 00:05:55,228
次は僕に付いてきなよ 暗闇でも
Follow me next, even in the darkness

17
00:05:55,728 --> 00:05:58,228
もう一回
One more time!

18
00:05:58,228 --> 00:06:01,728
幕は上がりだした
The curtain has begun to rise

19
00:06:01,728 --> 00:06:03,728
もう一回
One more time!

20
00:06:03,728 --> 00:06:07,728
色付けてく ここから
Adding colors from here on out

21
00:06:17,228 --> 00:06:22,228
10年後の僕らは すれ違いばかりで
Ten years from now,
we only pass each other by

22
00:06:22,228 --> 00:06:27,728
幻想に思いを馳せては 戻れないそう思い込んだ
Lost in fantasies,
I was convinced I could never go back

23
00:06:27,728 --> 00:06:32,728
くたびれた心に追い風を
A tailwind for my exhausted heart

24
00:06:32,728 --> 00:06:38,728
あの頃と変わらない夕日も何とも思わない
I feel nothing even looking at
the same sunset as back then

25
00:06:38,728 --> 00:06:43,728
自分を信じ歩いていければ どこまでだって登れるのにな
If I could just walk believing in myself,
I could climb anywhere

26
00:06:43,728 --> 00:06:48,728
葛藤が繋ぐその空白に 大切なもの見落としている
In the blank space connected by conflict,
I'm overlooking what's important

27
00:06:48,728 --> 00:06:54,728
見つけられないと泣き喚く君へ
To you, crying out that you can't find it

28
00:06:54,728 --> 00:06:59,728
いっせーのーで、声を上げて 聞こえてくるんだ
On the count of three, raise your voice,
I can hear it coming

29
00:06:59,728 --> 00:07:05,228
自分の影の長さに気付くもうこんな時間だ
Noticing the length of my own shadow,
it's already this late

30
00:07:05,228 --> 00:07:10,228
一等賞で駆け抜ける君 くっついてただけの僕でも
Even if I was just clinging to you
as you ran in first place

31
00:07:10,228 --> 00:07:18,228
君の前を歩けるかな こんな頼りない僕でも
I wonder if I can walk ahead of you,
even as unreliable as I am

32
00:07:37,728 --> 00:07:42,228
宝箱はホコリを かぶったまま無くした
The treasure chest was lost, covered in dust

33
00:07:42,228 --> 00:07:47,728
鍵はずっと君の ポケットの中にあった
The key was always inside your pocket

34
00:07:47,728 --> 00:07:53,228
散らばってた全てが 今一つに重なる
Everything that was scattered
is overlapping as one now

35
00:07:53,228 --> 00:07:58,728
手を取り始めよう 僕たちの物語
Let's take each other's hands
and begin our story

36
00:07:58,728 --> 00:08:00,928
もういいかい
Are you ready?

37
00:08:00,928 --> 00:08:03,928
かぶったまま失くした 鍵はずっと
Lost while covered, the key was always...

38
00:08:03,928 --> 00:08:06,928
君のポケットの中にあった
...inside your pocket

39
00:08:06,928 --> 00:08:09,528
散らばってたすべてが
Everything that was scattered...

40
00:08:09,528 --> 00:08:13,928
愛しくて
...is so precious

41
00:08:13,928 --> 00:08:16,928
今一つに重なる
Now overlapping as one

42
00:08:16,928 --> 00:08:19,728
掛け声はいつも
The rallying cry is always...

43
00:08:19,728 --> 00:08:22,728
いっせーのーで、声を上げて
...on the count of three, raise your voice!

44
00:08:22,728 --> 00:08:27,728
いっせーのーで、声を上げて 聞こえてくるんだ
On the count of three, raise your voice,
I can hear it coming

45
00:08:27,728 --> 00:08:33,228
自分の影の長さに気付くもうこんな時間だ
Noticing the length of my own shadow,
it's already this late

46
00:08:33,228 --> 00:08:38,228
