次は僕に付いてきなよ 暗闇でも
Follow me next, even in the darkness

48
00:08:44,228 --> 00:08:46,728
もう一回
One more time!

49
00:08:46,728 --> 00:08:49,728
泣き出した声で
With a tearful voice

50
00:08:49,728 --> 00:08:51,728
もう一回
One more time!

51
00:08:51,728 --> 00:08:54,728
笑う君が見えた
I saw you smiling

52
00:08:54,728 --> 00:08:57,228
もう一回
One more time!

53
00:08:57,228 --> 00:09:00,228
幕は上がりだした
The curtain has begun to rise

54
