色付けてく ここから
Adding colors from here on out

56
00:09:50,728 --> 00:09:56,728
曇天
作詞・作曲：氏原ワタル
Cloudy Weather
Lyrics & Composition: Wataru Ujihara

57
00:10:03,433 --> 00:10:08,833
鉛の空重く垂れ込み
The leaden sky hangs heavy and low,

58
00:10:08,833 --> 00:10:14,333
真白に澱んだ太陽が砕けて
as the pure white, stagnant sun shatters,

59
00:10:14,333 --> 00:10:21,033
耳鳴りを尖らせる
sharpening the ringing in my ears.

60
00:10:24,133 --> 00:10:29,033
ひゅるりひゅるり低いツバメが
Whirling, whirling, low-flying swallows...

61
00:10:29,033 --> 00:10:34,533
8の字なぞってビルの谷を翔る
...trace figure-eights, soaring through the buildings.

62
00:10:34,833 --> 00:10:41,033
もうじきに夕立が来る
An evening shower will soon be here.

63
00:10:41,033 --> 00:10:44,233
るるる
Ru ru ru...

64
00:10:44,233 --> 00:10:48,033
曇天の道を
Along the cloudy path,

65
00:10:48,033 --> 00:10:50,033
傘を忘れて
having forgotten her umbrella,

66
00:10:50,033 --> 00:10:52,533
歩く彼女は
she walks along,

67
00:10:52,533 --> 00:10:55,533
雨に怯えてる
fearing the rain.

68
00:10:55,633 --> 00:10:57,633
ので僕も
And so, I too,

69
00:10:57,633 --> 00:11:00,533
弱虫ぶら下げて
dragging my cowardice behind me,

70
00:11:00,533 --> 00:11:05,533
空を仰ぐ
look up at the sky.

71
00:11:08,833 --> 00:11:13,533
あちらこちらあんよは上手
Toddling here and there so skillfully,

72
00:11:13,733 --> 00:11:18,933
コーヒー屋に寄って 一休み決めたら
stopping by a coffee shop to take a rest.

73
00:11:19,433 --> 00:11:26,533
帰れない 帰らない
I can't go back, I won't go back.

74
00:11:27,733 --> 00:11:31,533
曇天の道を
Along the cloudy path,

75
00:11:31,533 --> 00:11:34,033
ぶらりぶらぶら
aimlessly wandering,

76
00:11:34,033 --> 00:11:36,533
歩く二人は
the two of us walk along,

77
00:11:36,533 --> 00:11:39,533
足軽の如く
like lowly foot soldiers,

78
00:11:39,533 --> 00:11:45,033
危険好きの誰かのふりをする
pretending to be thrill-seekers.

79
00:11:45,033 --> 00:11:50,033
小心者共
A pair of cowards.

80
00:12:08,033 --> 00:12:11,533
曇天の道を
Along the cloudy path,

81
00:12:11,533 --> 00:12:13,533
傘を忘れて
having forgotten her umbrella,

82
00:12:13,533 --> 00:12:16,233
歩く彼女は
she walks along,

83
00:12:16,233 --> 00:12:19,233
雨に怯えてる
fearing the rain.

84
00:12:19,233 --> 00:12:21,033
ので僕も
And so, I too,

85
00:12:21,033 --> 00:12:24,033
弱虫ぶら下げて
dragging my cowardice behind me,

86
00:12:24,033 --> 00:12:31,033
空を仰ぐ
look up at the sky.

87
00:12:55,433 --> 00:12:59,833
放っといて育つものなんだ なんだろう?
It's something that grows if you leave it alone. What is it?

88
00:13:00,033 --> 00:13:02,833
ももちゃん ももちゃん never never give up!
Momo-chan! Momo-chan! Never never give up!

89
00:13:02,833 --> 00:13:05,533
ももちゃん ももちゃん never give up!
Momo-chan! Momo-chan! Never give up!

90
00:13:05,533 --> 00:13:06,533
Perfect-area complete!

91
00:13:06,833 --> 00:13:13,033
運営さん、なんか放送エコーが切れてるかもしれないとのことで確認お願いします！
Staff, they're saying the broadcast echo might be off, so please check it!

92
00:13:16,233 --> 00:13:19,033
出会いましては簡単すぎるよ
Meeting someone is way too easy.

93
00:13:19,033 --> 00:13:21,833
最初に決めた答えはひとつ
The answer I first decided on is just one.

94
00:13:21,833 --> 00:13:24,433
ときめきまして合格しますか?
My heart throbbed. Do I pass?

95
00:13:24,433 --> 00:13:27,033
恋も勝負もあわてない
No need to rush in love or competition.

96
00:13:27,033 --> 00:13:30,033
コツコツコツと徹夜にため息
Step by step, studying all night with a sigh,

97
00:13:30,033 --> 00:13:32,033
私のなかに天才dreamer
there's a genius dreamer inside of me.

98
00:13:32,033 --> 00:13:35,033
思うことみな叶えばいいな
I hope all my wishes come true.

99
00:13:35,033 --> 00:13:37,433
人の世界は気にしない
I don't care about other people's worlds.

100
00:13:37,433 --> 00:13:40,033
Perfect-area complete!

101
00:13:40,033 --> 00:13:42,533
絶対ここで待ってるんだ
I'll definitely be waiting right here.

102
00:13:42,533 --> 00:13:48,533
Perfect-area 望む声が聞こえるよ
I can hear the voices calling for the perfect-area!

103
00:13:48,533 --> 00:13:51,033
あ、いやいやいや！
Ah, iya iya iya!

104
00:13:51,033 --> 00:13:53,433
Why? とまらないすれちがい
Why? These endless near-misses...

105
00:13:53,433 --> 00:13:56,033
私が相談相手なら
...if I were the one you consulted with...

106
00:13:56,033 --> 00:13:58,533
「友達かい?」「友達です。」
"Are we friends?" "Yes, we are friends."

107
00:13:58,533 --> 00:14:01,033
悲しき0点だね
That's a sad score of zero, isn't it?

108
00:14:01,033 --> 00:14:03,533
No! やりなおしかきなおし
No! Redo it, rewrite it!

109
00:14:03,533 --> 00:14:06,033
本気で one more chance please
I'm serious, one more chance please!

110
00:14:06,033 --> 00:14:11,033
いまより素敵な未来があるのに
Even though there's a more wonderful future out there,

111
00:14:11,033 --> 00:14:18,033
いまより素敵に my life, my life, my life!!
make my life even more wonderful than now!

112
00:14:20,533 --> 00:14:24,033
ありがとうございます！みんなもありがとう！
Thank you so much! Thank you everyone, too!

113
00:14:28,833 --> 00:14:31,533
願いましたよ月にも星にも
I made a wish to the moon and stars,

114
00:14:31,533 --> 00:14:34,033
科学的にはどうにもならず
even though science can't do anything about it.

115
00:14:34,033 --> 00:14:37,033
かがやき増したあしたを夢見て
Dreaming of a tomorrow that shines even brighter,

116
00:14:37,033 --> 00:14:39,533
恋でガマンを学んだね
I learned patience through love.

117
00:14:39,533 --> 00:14:42,533
ムクムクムクと広がる雨雲
Billowing and growing, the rain clouds spread,

118
00:14:42,533 --> 00:14:44,533
私を濡らす瞬間squall
a sudden squall soaking me in an instant.

119
00:14:44,533 --> 00:14:47,433
悩みごとほら流れたみたい
Look, it feels like all my worries washed away.

120
00:14:47,433 --> 00:14:49,833
泣き言なんて忘れよう
Let's forget about all our complaints!

121
00:14:49,833 --> 00:14:52,533
Passive-nature conversation!

122
00:14:52,533 --> 00:14:55,233
感動したいもっとずっと
I want to be moved, much more and forever.

123
00:14:55,233 --> 00:15:00,033
passive-nature 自分次第変われるよ
Passive-nature, I can change if it's up to me!

124
00:15:01,341 --> 00:15:02,641
はい、はい、はい、はーい！
Yes, yes, yes, yeees!

125
00:15:02,641 --> 00:15:07,941
さりげなく聞いてみた 私の勉強増駆して
I casually asked, "If I boost my studying,

126
00:15:07,941 --> 00:15:13,141
可能性ありますか？ 試験は何点かな？
do I have a chance? What score will I get on the test?"

127
00:15:13,141 --> 00:15:18,141
誰だって 君だって 間に合うギブアンドテイク
Anyone, even you, can make it in time with a give-and-take.

128
00:15:18,141 --> 00:15:23,141
これから始まる季節にあいさつ
Greeting the season that's about to begin.

129
00:15:23,141 --> 00:15:29,041
これから始める マインド マイライフ マイライフ
Starting from now: my mind, my life, my life!

130
00:15:57,841 --> 00:16:02,841
気がついた時には
By the time I realized it...

131
00:16:02,841 --> 00:16:08,041
生まれてた なぜだろう
...I was already born. I wonder why.

132
00:16:08,041 --> 00:16:13,141
さあね
Who knows?

133
00:16:13,141 --> 00:16:18,841
意識はもう 育ちつつあるよ 強く強くね
My consciousness is already growing, strongly and steadily.

134
00:16:21,341 --> 00:16:24,841
もう 止まらない この気持ち
These feelings won't stop anymore.

135
00:16:24,841 --> 00:16:29,341
私の勉強増駆して 可能性ありますか？
If I boost my studying, do I have a chance?

136
00:16:29,341 --> 00:16:32,841
それとも0点かな？
Or will I get a zero?

137
00:16:32,841 --> 00:16:37,341
やり直し 書き直し 本気でワンモアチャンス
Redo it, rewrite it, seriously give me one more chance!

138
00:16:37,341 --> 00:16:42,341
今より素敵な未来があるから
Because there's a better future waiting than now.

139
00:16:42,341 --> 00:16:48,341
今より素敵に マインド マイライフ マイライフ
More wonderfully than now: my mind, my life, my life!

140
00:16:53,341 --> 00:16:58,341
はい！というわけで始まりました！
All right! And so it has begun!

141
00:16:58,341 --> 00:17:03,341
2026年も桃鈴ねね誕生日、イェーイ！
The 2026 Momosuzu Nene Birthday Live! Yay!

142
00:17:03,341 --> 00:17:08,841
みんな、コメントも見えてるよ！ありがとう！
Everyone, I can see your comments! Thank you!

143
00:17:08,841 --> 00:17:13,141
あ、これ、気づいてくれた人ありがとう。ねね、これ脱ぐと死んじゃう病だから
Ah, thanks to those who noticed. Because Nene has a disease where she'll die if she takes this off.

144
00:17:13,141 --> 00:17:15,641
はい、というわけで、今回のハッシュタグはこちら！
All right, so our hashtag for today is this!

145
00:17:15,641 --> 00:17:20,841
「#桃鈴ねね誕生日ライブ2026」です！
It's "#MomosuzuNeneBirthdayLive2026"!

146
00:17:20,841 --> 00:17:23,341
今ちょっと、エゴサのほうがバグっちゃってるんで
Right now, the vanity search is a bit bugged,

147
00:17:23,341 --> 00:17:28,841
こっちでツイートしてくれたらめっちゃ嬉しいです！よろしくお願いします！
so I'd be super happy if you'd tweet with this! Thank you!

148
00:17:28,841 --> 00:17:33,341
今日はね、超重大告知があるので
Today, we have a super major announcement,

149
00:17:33,341 --> 00:17:37,841
最後まで楽しんでいってください！
so please enjoy the show until the very end!

150
00:17:37,841 --> 00:17:41,341
さあ、今、3曲お聞きいただいたんですけど
Now, you've just listened to three songs,

151
00:17:41,341 --> 00:17:45,541
ねねの好きな曲
all of Nene's favorite songs:

152
00:17:45,541 --> 00:17:49,341
「銀魂」、「ばかてす」っていう感じでね<
"Gintama" and "BakaTest", like that.

153
00:17:49,341 --> 00:17:52,841
もうねねの好きな曲しかない3曲をやりましたけど
We did three songs that only consist of Nene's favorites,

154
00:17:52,841 --> 00:17:56,841
3曲目に一番、歌、歌がきついの持ってきちゃって
and I put the hardest song to sing as the third one,

155
