362
00:33:13,272 --> 00:33:16,572
あれ、ちょっと待って、二人とも可愛くない？
Wait, hold on, aren't you two being too cute?

363
00:33:16,572 --> 00:33:19,072
裏切ったな！裏切ったな！
You betrayed me! You betrayed me!

364
00:33:36,572 --> 00:33:40,572
無口なハート開いたら<
Once you open your quiet heart...

365
00:33:40,872 --> 00:33:45,872
進もう、声合わせて
...let's move forward, raising our voices together.

366
00:33:47,572 --> 00:33:51,572
キラキラしている自分を
Catch hold of your own sparkling self...

367
00:33:51,872 --> 00:33:57,872
つかもう、大好きなことしよう
...and let's do what we love!

368
00:33:58,572 --> 00:34:03,572
勝ち負けだなんて関係ないともがく
Struggling, knowing that winning or losing doesn't matter...

369
00:34:04,072 --> 00:34:09,072
手と手繋いで、ヘイ、パーティーをはじめよう！
...let's hold hands, hey, and start the party!

370
00:34:12,572 --> 00:34:14,072
Let's go party!

371
00:34:14,572 --> 00:34:19,572
Step up, one, two, three, 未来へ
Step up, 1, 2, 3, towards the future!

372
00:34:19,572 --> 00:34:24,572
そう、ずっとみんなで、絶対諦めたくないから
Yes, forever together, because we never want to give up!

373
00:34:25,572 --> 00:34:31,072
Let's find, do my best, 明日はきっと輝いてる
Let's find and do our best, tomorrow will surely shine!

374
00:34:31,072 --> 00:34:37,072
力合わせて、ときめき探してゆく
Joining our strength, we'll go searching for excitement.

375
00:34:37,072 --> 00:34:40,072
つかみ取ろう、プリパラ！
Let's seize it, PriPara!

376
00:34:51,572 --> 00:34:55,572
くよくよしている自分を
The self that is worrying and fretting...

377
00:34:55,872 --> 00:35:00,072
変えよう、みんながついてるよ
...let's change it, everyone is here with you!

378
00:35:01,072 --> 00:35:04,072
どんな風だって...
No matter what kind of wind...

379
00:35:05,060 --> 00:35:07,260
