382
00:35:12,460 --> 00:35:16,460
ほら 夢が始まる
Look, our dream is beginning!

383
00:35:16,460 --> 00:35:18,860
3, 2, 1, Go!
Three, two, one, go!

384
00:35:18,860 --> 00:35:21,860
Let's dance, dance with me 未来へ
Let's dance, dance with me into the future!

385
00:35:21,860 --> 00:35:24,460
そう ずっと みんなで
Yes, together with everyone forever!

386
00:35:24,460 --> 00:35:29,360
絶対 手放したくないから
Because I definitely don't want to let go!

387
00:35:29,360 --> 00:35:32,760
Let's sing, do my best! 明日は
Let's sing, do my best! Tomorrow...

388
00:35:32,760 --> 00:35:35,860
もっと 輝いている
...will be even brighter!

389
00:35:35,860 --> 00:35:38,460
希望を掲げて
Holding up our hopes,

390
00:35:38,460 --> 00:35:41,560
ときめき探して
searching for excitement,

391
00:35:41,560 --> 00:35:45,060
２人のモノガタリ
our story...

392
00:35:45,060 --> 00:35:47,560
うまくいかない日とか
On days when things don't go well,

393
00:35:47,560 --> 00:35:49,860
すれ違いばかりで
or when we keep passing each other by,

394
00:35:49,860 --> 00:35:53,560
ダメになりそうな時は 一緒に
when everything seems hopeless, let's be together!

395
00:35:55,160 --> 00:36:00,760
描くオリジナルの夢を叶えよう
Let's make our self-drawn, original dreams come true!

396
00:36:00,760 --> 00:36:06,360
笑顔 受け取ろう
Let's receive those smiles!

397
00:36:17,460 --> 00:36:20,560
そう 一緒に歌いたい
Yes, I want to sing together!

398
00:36:20,560 --> 00:36:23,460
ねえ 一緒に踊りたい
Hey, I want to dance together!

399
00:36:23,460 --> 00:36:28,060
絶対 諦めないよ
I will absolutely never give up!

400
00:36:28,060 --> 00:36:30,060
Let's go!

401
00:36:30,060 --> 00:36:33,060
Let's dance, dance with me 未来へ
Let's dance, dance with me into the future!

402
00:36:33,060 --> 00:36:35,860
そう ずっと みんなで
Yes, together with everyone forever!

403
00:36:35,860 --> 00:36:40,860
絶対 諦めたくないから
Because I definitely don't want to give up!

404
00:36:40,860 --> 00:36:44,160
Let's sing, do my best! 明日はきっと
Let's sing, do my best! Tomorrow, surely...

405
00:36:44,160 --> 00:36:47,060
輝いている
...we will be shining!

406
00:36:47,060 --> 00:36:49,860
力合わせて
Combining our strength,

407
00:36:49,860 --> 00:36:52,860
ときめき探して
searching for excitement,

408
00:36:52,860 --> 00:36:56,560
つかみとろう
let's seize it!

409
00:37:19,360 --> 00:37:22,560
はーい！お疲れ！
