410
00:37:22,560 --> 00:37:24,460
Let's dance! Let's dance...

411
00:37:24,460 --> 00:37:27,060
お疲れ様！
Great job!

412
00:37:29,060 --> 00:37:31,060
一旦、ねね！
First of all, Nene!

413
00:37:31,060 --> 00:37:35,060
お誕生日おめでとう！
Happy birthday!

414
00:37:35,060 --> 00:37:37,460
ありがとう！
Thank you!

415
00:37:37,460 --> 00:37:40,060
ちょっとね、コメントと30秒くらい差があるんだって
Apparently, there's about a 30-second delay with comments.

416
