お暴れ〜！
Let's run wild!

430
00:38:10,060 --> 00:38:11,560
あ、時間ない！時間ない！
Oh, we're out of time! Out of time!

431
00:38:11,560 --> 00:38:13,560
ポーズ！ポーズとって！
Pose! Let's take a pose!

432
