うわー！
Whoa!

435
00:38:22,560 --> 00:38:26,060
無理無理無理無理！
No way, no way, no way!

436
00:38:31,060 --> 00:38:36,060
Peko, and! 私始めない？
Peko, and! Shall we not begin?

437
00:38:36,060 --> 00:38:37,560
なんてね
Just kidding!

438
00:38:49,260 --> 00:38:54,060
トーストかじって 交差点でぶつかる
Biting a toast, colliding at the intersection...

439
00:38:54,060 --> 00:38:59,060
そういうんじゃないけど 予感はしてたよ
It wasn't quite like that, but I had a premonition.

440
00:38:59,060 --> 00:39:04,060
ピッとね 運命だね 会えるって信じてた
Like a spark, it's destiny! I believed we'd meet.

441
00:39:04,060 --> 00:39:10,060
君専用の笑顔 満開 オッケー！
A full bloom smile just for you, okay?

442
00:39:10,060 --> 00:39:16,060
口が出たり ため息ついたり あるよね わかるよ
Complaining or sighing, it happens, doesn't it? I understand.

443
00:39:19,060 --> 00:39:22,560
君が寂しくて泣いてるなら
If you're crying because you're lonely,

444
00:39:22,560 --> 00:39:25,260
イライラしてたまらないなら
if you're so frustrated you can't stand it,

445
00:39:25,260 --> 00:39:30,560
あたしの出番だな その手をつないで連れてくよ
then it's my turn! I'll take your hand and lead the way!

446
00:39:30,560 --> 00:39:33,060
ようこそ 素敵なテーマパーク
Welcome to this wonderful theme park!

447
00:39:33,060 --> 00:39:36,060
もういっそ 全部忘れちゃえ
You might as well just forget everything!

448
00:39:36,060 --> 00:39:40,560
とりあえずは あたしたちだけ見て
For now, just look at only us!

449
00:39:40,560 --> 00:39:46,060
ココロの中 まだちょっと考えられないくらい
So much so that you still can't think of anything else...

450
00:39:46,060 --> 00:39:50,560
愛をあげる 君が好きだ
...I'll give you all my love, because I love you!

451
00:39:50,560 --> 00:39:54,060
Peko, and! 私始めない？
Peko, and! Shall we not begin?

452
00:39:54,060 --> 00:39:57,060
なんてね
Just kidding!

453
00:40:07,196 --> 00:40:11,596
どうやら フラグは まだ立っていないみたいだ
It seems the flag hasn't been raised yet.

454
00:40:11,596 --> 00:40:16,596
そんなの 気にしない 一直線に 進む
I don't care about that, I'll go straight ahead!

455
00:40:16,596 --> 00:40:21,896
きっとね 安牌だね お決まりのシチュエーション
Surely it's a safe bet, the usual situation.

456
00:40:21,896 --> 00:40:27,296
2人きりの空間 3、2、1、OK!
A space for just the two of us... 3, 2, 1, OK!

457
00:40:27,296 --> 00:40:32,496
舞い上がっちゃって あとで反省会
Getting all excited, then having a self-reflection meeting.

458
00:40:32,496 --> 00:40:36,596
あるよね 解るよ
That happens, I totally get it.

459
00:40:36,596 --> 00:40:41,896
脳内選挙して 眠れないなら
If you can't sleep from overthinking in your head,

460
00:40:41,896 --> 00:40:46,896
戸惑い 地団駄 堪らないなら
if you're bewildered and stomping your feet,

461
00:40:46,896 --> 00:40:49,896
いつだって おいでよ 少しずつ 積み上げていこう
come over anytime! Let's build it up little by little.

462
00:40:49,896 --> 00:40:54,896
ようこそ 無限のパラダイム
Welcome to the infinite paradigm!

463
00:40:54,896 --> 00:40:59,896
いっそ ずっと 一緒にいよう
Might as well stay together forever.

464
00:40:59,896 --> 00:41:04,896
とことんまで 笑っていてね
Keep smiling to the very end.

465
00:41:04,896 --> 00:41:09,896
もっと 求めてほしいんだぞ
I want you to crave me even more!

466
00:41:09,896 --> 00:41:14,896
そっと 掴んだ シャツの裾
Gently grabbing the hem of your shirt...

467
00:41:14,896 --> 00:41:19,896
最上級を プレゼントしよう
Let me give you the absolute best present!

468
00:41:30,596 --> 00:41:35,396
深く考えなくてもいいよ
You don't have to think too deeply.

469
00:41:35,396 --> 00:41:40,196
ただ楽しいを続けよう
Let's just keep having fun.

470
00:41:40,196 --> 00:41:48,596
繋いだ今日が明日になっていくんだ
The today we connected will become tomorrow.

471
00:41:53,496 --> 00:41:59,396
よーそろー 全速前進で
Steady as she goes, full speed ahead!

472
00:41:59,396 --> 00:42:04,396
とんでもない 景色 見に行こう
Let's go see some unbelievable sights!

473
00:42:04,396 --> 00:42:09,396
乗りかかってる自覚あるでしょう？
You realize you've already committed to this, right?

474
00:42:09,396 --> 00:42:14,296
そんじょそこらのストーリーじゃもう満足できないくらい
To the point where an ordinary story won't satisfy you,

475
00:42:14,296 --> 00:42:16,896
夢中になれる
you'll get hooked...

476
00:42:16,896 --> 00:42:19,296
夢中にさせる
...I'll make you fall for it!

477
00:42:24,096 --> 00:42:29,696
ようこそ 素敵なテーマパーク
Welcome to this wonderful theme park!

478
00:42:29,696 --> 00:42:34,696
いっそ 全部 忘れちゃえ
Might as well just forget everything.

479
00:42:34,696 --> 00:42:39,696
とりあえずは 私だけ 見て
For now, look only at me!

480
00:42:39,696 --> 00:42:44,896
そっと流し目の向こうまで
Softly, beyond your sidelong glance...

481
00:42:44,896 --> 00:42:49,896
ちょっと考えられないくらい
To an almost unthinkable extent,

482
00:42:49,896 --> 00:42:54,896
愛をあげる 君が好きだ
I'll give you love, I love you!

483
00:42:54,896 --> 00:42:59,696
限界なんて関係ないじゃん
Limits don't even matter, do they?

484
00:42:59,696 --> 00:43:04,696
今だってほら笑ってんじゃん
See, you're smiling even now!

485
00:43:04,696 --> 00:43:09,696
永遠に私を信じない？なんてね
Why not believe in me forever? Just kidding!

486
00:42:53,096 --> 00:42:58,096
ギターと孤独と蒼い惑星
[Title: Guitar, Loneliness and Blue Planet]

487
00:43:05,196 --> 00:43:10,596
突然降る夕立 あぁ傘もないや嫌
A sudden evening shower, ah, I don't even have an umbrella, how annoying.

488
00:43:10,596 --> 00:43:15,596
空のご機嫌なんか知らない
I don't care about the mood of the sky.

489
00:43:17,896 --> 00:43:22,596
季節の変わり目の服は何着りゃいいんだろ
What should I wear during the change of seasons?

490
00:43:22,596 --> 00:43:27,596
春と秋どこいっちゃったんだよ
Where did spring and autumn go?

491
00:43:27,596 --> 00:43:32,596
息も出来ない 情報の圧力
I can't even breathe under the pressure of information.

492
00:43:32,596 --> 00:43:37,596
めまいの螺旋だ わたしはどこにいる
It's a spiral of dizziness, where am I?

493
00:43:37,596 --> 00:43:42,596
こんなに こんなに 息の音がするのに
Even though I can hear my breath so clearly,

494
