馬鹿なわたしは歌うだけ
A fool like me can only sing.

499
00:44:08,596 --> 00:44:11,296
ぶちまけちゃおうか 星に
Should I just pour it all out to the stars?

500
00:44:22,096 --> 00:44:27,096
エリクサーに張り替える作業もなんとなくなんだ
The work of changing to Elixir strings is also just half-hearted.

501
